OL,3,GNEWSADrumcree parade decision to be
OL,4,Achallenged in High Court
OL,5,
OL,6,FA legal challenge to the Parades
OL,7,FCommission's decision to allow the
OL,8,FOrange Order to march on the
OL,9,Fmainly-nationalist Garvaghy Road in
OL,10,FPortadown is take place on Saturday
OL,11,Fmorning.
OL,13,FThe commission announced that a the
OL,14,Fparade can go ahead on Sunday, for the
OL,15,Ffirst time in almost 30 years, with
OL,16,Frestrictions in place.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,412,410,260,120,0,100
