OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSADrumcree parade decision to be
OL,4,Achallenged in High Court
OL,5,
OL,6,FRather than start at 13:00 BST on
OL,7,FSunday as intended, the commission has
OL,8,Fsaid the march can depart no later than
OL,9,F08:00 and with 35 participants rather
OL,10,Fthan the 60 the Orange Order requested.
OL,11,FNo bands or supporters are allowed.
OL,13,FThe decision is facing the legal
OL,14,Fchallenge from the Garvaghy Road
OL,15,FResidents' Coalition, which opposes the
OL,16,Fmarch.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
